# Error Documentation - SkyFlipperSolo

**Project:** SkyFlipperSolo
**Last Updated:** 2026-03-19

## Known Issues

### 1. Potential `/flips` Hydration Warnings
**Status:** Investigate if still occurring.
**Context:** Frontend `client/app/flips/page.tsx` depends on browser APIs (Notification, window). Some hydration warnings were mitigated with mounted guard.
**Possible Fix:** Wrap route with no-SSR client wrapper if warnings persist.

### 2. Low-Data Reference Sets
**Status:** Expected in fresh DB.
**Context:** Reference-auction engine needs enough sold history; low volume items may produce weak references early.
**Mitigation:** Let ingestion run longer; add real-data fixtures.

### 3. Enchant List Gaps (P0)
**Status:** Resolved — `CacheKeyService.RelevantEnchants` aligned to `dev/Data/Flipper/Constants.cs`.
**Context:** Items with missing enchants (e.g., `smoldering`, `quantum`, `replenish`, `critical(7)`) would not match properly.
**Fix:** Copied missing entries and added missing enum values in `Models/Enchantment.cs`.

### 4. CacheKey Format Divergence (P0)
**Status:** Resolved — Raw `String.Concat(Dictionary)` concatenation restored.
**Context:** Sorted keys + range normalization prevented cross-compatibility with Coflnet AveragePrice data.
**Fix:** BuildNbtString now concatenates raw flattened NBT and only filters ignored keys (and gems when requested).

### 5. SQL-Level NBT Filtering Missing (P1)
**Status:** Resolved — GetSelect now applies NBTLookup filters at DB level before candidate sampling.
**Context:** Reference uses `AddNBTSelect`/`AddNbtRangeSelect` for DB-level filtering.
**Fix:** Added NBTKey/NBTValue-backed IQueryable filters for range and exact matches.

### 8. Missing Pet Exp Guard (P0)
**Status:** Resolved — `ShouldPetItemMatch` now requires `exp` key.
**Context:** Reference guards on `flatNbt.ContainsKey("exp")`; missing guard allowed matches without exp.
**Fix:** Added guard and parity test.

### 6. AveragePrice.CacheKey Length (P1)
**Status:** Open — Column is `varchar(200)` but range-normalized cache keys can exceed 200 chars.
**Context:** Already fixed FlipHitCount.CacheKey to `text`. AveragePrice.CacheKey needs same treatment.
**Fix:** Create migration to widen to `text`.

### 7. IMemoryCache Reference Sets (P1)
**Status:** Resolved — Redis-backed distributed cache added.
**Context:** Reference sets lost on restart; not shared across instances.
**Fix:** `ReferenceCacheService` stores reference IDs in Redis with 2h TTL.

### 13. AveragePrice.CacheKey Length (P1)
**Status:** Resolved — widened to `varchar(600)`.
**Context:** Raw cache keys can exceed 200 chars, risk of truncation.
**Fix:** Migration `WidenAveragePriceCacheKey` updates column length.

### 10. Legacy NBTLookup Fields Removed
**Status:** Completed — `Key` and `ValueString` removed from `NBTLookups`.
**Context:** Only KeyId/ValueId now used for NBT filtering and display.
**Fix:** Migration `RemoveLegacyNbtLookupFields` drops columns and legacy indexes.

### 11. NBT Query Helper Extraction
**Status:** Completed — SQL-level NBT filtering extracted into `NbtQueryHelper`.
**Context:** Previously embedded in `ReferenceAuctionService` and hard to maintain.
**Fix:** Helper encapsulates exact/range/pet/candy selection logic.

### 12. NBT Lookup Resolver Centralized
**Status:** Completed — `NbtLookupResolver` now handles KeyId/ValueId lookups with caching.
**Context:** Duplicate DB queries existed across NBT filters.
**Fix:** Resolver is injected and reused.

### 14. Metrics Endpoint Missing (P3)
**Status:** Resolved — Prometheus metrics exposed at `/metrics`.
**Context:** No observability for flip detection/reference selection.
**Fix:** Added prometheus-net and basic counters/histograms.

### 9. SelectBestEnchant Ordering (P0)
**Status:** Resolved — WorthOrder/WorthOrderLevels ported from reference.
**Context:** Reduced-mode matching could select the wrong enchant with simple sorting.
**Fix:** SelectBestEnchant now checks WorthOrderLevels then WorthOrder.
